  intros u m i c1 c2.
  replace (m * i + (c1 + c2)) with (c1 + (m * i + c2)) by lia.
  rewrite !rep_add, repmul_1RB1LC_0LA0RD_1RD1LA____0RB. reflexivity.
Qed.

