  - exists (4 * j + 4), (cden [] [] j BB1_1RB1LC_0LA0RD_1RD1LA____1RB).
    split; [lia|]. split; [| exact (gbo_1RB1LC_0LA0RD_1RD1LA____1RB j)].
    rewrite (gso_1RB1LC_0LA0RD_1RD1LA____1RB p j E).
