    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB1LC_0LA1RD_0RB1LA_0RB0LB [SWinR 2; SCycL 2 0; SWin 3] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
